WEBVTT

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.200
Doesn't this kind of feel like everyone's just hanging out in the club room?

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.580
We do this every day.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:27.090
Yeah, but shouldn't we be doing something more club-like?

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.630
Another bad end!

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.050
Silence, Meat.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.260
What is wrong with this game?!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.010
Kaguyama-san, you don't want to be friends with me no matter what?

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.270
Did you have to break it?!

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.430
There are two kinds of girls in this world.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.060
Girls that will get along with me,

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.400
and all the other bitches.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:53.240
So, Kodaka, what are we doing today?

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.410
I'm open to suggestions, if you have any.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:03.040
How about a relay novel?

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.050
What's a relay novel?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.550
We take turn writing part of a novel.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:46.020
They did something like that in a
book I was reading the other day.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.980
It seemed like a lot of fun.

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.350
Senpai,

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:52.940
I've never written a normal novel before.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.440
What do you mean by "normal"?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.440
I haven't either, Aniki.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.990
Me neither!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:03.030
I once spent my days writing them.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:07.700
'Twas the sole solace in my solitude.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.960
So wait, that thing was a novel?

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.750
I remember a whole bunch of weird symbols painting the pages black.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.130
An-chan! Don't just read my notebook like that!

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.760
I just saw one page.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.430
Well it's not like I've written one, either.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.810
How about we just do it our own way?

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.560
So, how do we do it?

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.940
When you hit the end of a page,

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:35.270
you hand it over to the next person, even if you're in the middle of a sentence.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.860
Let's start with the order.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.030
Alright!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.870
Okay! Go ahead, Yukimura-kun.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:52.620
Aniki, I shall come before you.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.330
S-Sure. Go ahead...

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.800
<b>Once upon a time, in a land far away,
there was an Aniki named Kodaka.</b>

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:05.930
Why me?!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:11.350
Aniki was a great man, talented in both the literary and martial arts,

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:17.570
one who scorned the strong and helped the weak.

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:20.860
A true samurai with great charisma, loved by all the people.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:28.950
One day, Aniki went into town to rape as usual.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.620
A true samurai wouldn't rape anyone!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.120
And "as usual"? So I'm a repeat offender?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.040
Kodaka, you're blushing like an idiot.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.210
Disgusting. Sex criminal.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.510
I never did it!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:48.140
Yozora told me that you raped 100 girls every day.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.970
What kind of messed up stuff are you telling him?

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:59.940
Aniki went to put on his sandals, but to his surprise, though it was winter, his sandals were warm.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:00.400
Aniki was angered and called for me, his sandal-bearer.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.860
Yukimura!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:03.950
Aniki was angered and called for me, his sandal-bearer.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:09.200
Yukimura! You sat on my sandals, didn't you?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.620
You insolent fool!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.910
I did not.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.290
I held your sandals at my chest.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.430
When I did, Aniki praised me.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:32.270
Your devotion is worth praise.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.390
Continue to serve me from now on.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:41.360
And so, I swore eternal devotion to Aniki.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.400
And they lived happily ever after.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:51.700
Yukimura, it's a relay novel, so you can't finish it with the first writer...

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.620
Oh my. My apologies.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.160
I shouldn't have done that.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:01.130
And this is just a copy of the story of
Hideyoshi as Nobunaga's sandal-bearer.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.920
So you knew it? That's my Aniki.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.380
Hold it, Senpai!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:07.880
You're forgetting the most important insertion point!

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:07.930
You're forgetting the most important insertion point!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.220
Here!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.680
He takes off his shirt and shows you his chest!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.760
Yukimura-kun is so bold!

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.430
Huh? But we're both guys.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.230
It's exactly because you're both guys!

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:23.440
It was embarrassing to write, but I would show Aniki everything.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.530
Yes!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.450
Kodaka-senpai x Yukimura-kun!

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.620
I'm so aroused right now, my head could explode!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.580
Senpai, have you had sex with Yukimura-kun?

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.200
Hell no!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.660
But homosexuality is normal for samurai!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.250
I'm not a samurai...

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:44.880
If Aniki so desires, he can do whatever he wishes to me.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.880
I can feel it!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.640
I need to turn this feeling in my chest into material, now!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:55.600
Yozora-senpai, can I switch places with you in the order?!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.430
No.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.520
You're making me feel really gross.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.140
How unfortunate.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:02.650
I'll spend my time imagining until my turn comes, instead.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:10.030
It's my turn next.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.580
Kodaka went to town with his underling, Yukimura.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:26.090
When they reached town, they saw a woman surrounded by a bunch of men getting raped.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:35.350
The woman being raped was blonde with blue eyes and disgusting, lewd cowtits.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.520
She also looked stupid.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.980
Are you stupid?!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.020
Why am I getting raped in the middle of town?!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.560
No one said it was you.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:51.240
Or do you admit that you're blonde with blue eyes and lewd cowtits and look stupid?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.990
The lewd and stupid parts are completely wrong.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.580
O-Oink!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.120
Please save this ugly, disgusting pig!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:07.500
This pitiful female pig's name is Kashiwazaki Sena! Oink!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:10.510
You just wrote my name!

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.880
