00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.840
You were counting?

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:31.650
Be grateful that I called you by your name, Kashiwazaki Sena.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.990
W-Well...

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:42.040
The slimy female pig, Kashiwazaki Sena, begged Kodaka to save her like the pig she was.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.080
Save me! Oink!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:50.760
Save this woman named Kashiwazaki Sena whose life has less value than that of a common cockroach!

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:54.300
There's no point in calling for help, Kashiwazaki Sena!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:59.640
You're so full of yourself just because you're rich and know how to study a little.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:03.100
