00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.210
Save me! Save me!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.250
Save Kashiwazaki Sena!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.420
No thanks.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.720
I'm only interested in little girls.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:43.930
Kodaka was only interested in little girls, so he left Kashiwazaki Sena to find better prey.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.810
Kodaka! Why didn't you save me?!

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.770
Don't ask me!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:53.110
