00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.490
Onii-chan's writing next?

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:03.950
Wait!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:24.060
I pretended to leave Sena to her demise, but then I defeated the thugs.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.020
Th-Thank you.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.850
