00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:39.240
According to the thugs, their hideout was a cave to the west.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:47.500
I headed to the villains' hideout to slay them in order to bring peace to the people of the town.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:50.670
Of course, I had no intention of
raping anyone in the first place,

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.920
