00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:23.280
Onii-chan's so cool!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:28.200
Such is nothing for my kindred.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:31.420
Aniki is a true man among men.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:41.630
I guess projecting yourself onto the main character and
escaping from the pain of reality is one way to enjoy a story.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:43.930
What's that supposed to mean?

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.220
Now then, it's my turn next.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.190
