00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:15.190
And that goddess was a completely perfect girl, Kashiwazaki Sena.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.690
As you can see, I'm God.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:21.320
Getting assaulted by worthless scum in town was simply a test for humanity.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:25.780
I could have easily destroyed that trash in an instant.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.450
Perish, evil!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.910
Ow! Stop that!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:37.920
Oink...

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:41.550
Kneel before me and beg for your life, Yozora.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.960
