00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.880
I couldn't possibly...

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.690
Like hell I'd lick your shoes!!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:35.530
You idiot! Poopy Yozora!!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.250
Should we keep going?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.040
