00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:22.680
The quivering sensation of two souls in resonance!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:47.960
The name of the girl whose left and right eyes shone in discrepant colors was Reisis V. Felicity Sumeragi.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:51.340
A Child of the Night and a Child of the Day.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:57.180
