The evil vampire was accepted into Heaven.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.260
Really?

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:31.940
So the moral is that you shouldn't hold it in when you need to go?

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.400
That's right!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.230
Ow!

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:38.490
